        {
          "text": "I fell down at his feet to worship him, but he said to me, “Don't do it! I am a servant together with you and with your fellow-believers, all those who hold to the truth that Jesus revealed. Worship God!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
