        },
        {
          "text": "Then I saw heaven open, and there was a white horse. Its rider is called Faithful and True; it is with justice that he judges and fights his battles. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.10.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 10.6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "His eyes were like a flame of fire, and he wore many crowns on his head. He had a name written on him, but no one except himself knows what it is. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The robe he wore was covered with blood. His name is “The Word of God”. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The armies of heaven followed him, riding on white horses and dressed in clean white linen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
