              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rev 14.20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Out of his mouth came a sharp sword, with which he will defeat the nations. He will rule over them with a rod of iron, and he will trample out the wine in the winepress of the furious anger of the Almighty God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On his robe and on his thigh was written the name: “King of kings and Lord of lords”.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
